Output demo.gif

Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 14
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Width 920
Set Height 580
Set Padding 24
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 28
Set BorderRadius 8

# welcome screen
Type "sage"
Enter
Sleep 3s

# disk question
Sleep 1s
Type `sage "why is my disk full"`
Enter
Sleep 30s
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 120s

Sleep 2s
